      "content": "but the ER is like 30 mins away and i dont even have my car rn... i feel okay enough to drive if i have to, i just hate hospitals. the throat thing is just a little scratchy, it's not like i can't breathe or anything. if i just take a double dose of Benadryl will that fix the itching so i can just sleep? i dont want to make a huge deal out of nothing.",
